  "description": "A powerful .NET library that provides attribute-based method timing and logging decorators using Fody. Automatically measure and log method execution time with four different output targets: console, structured logging, database, or CSV files. Zero runtime overhead with compile-time instrumentation. Supports .NET 6.0 and higher.",
