  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.0.2:\n- Added package logo and icon\n- README included in package\n\nInitial release features:\n- TimerAttribute: Console-based timing\n- LogTimerAttribute: ILogger integration\n- DBLogTimerAttribute: Database persistence\n- CSVLogTimerAttribute: CSV file logging\n- Compile-time instrumentation via Fody\n- Thread-safe implementations\n- Comprehensive test coverage (71 tests)\n- Global and per-instance configuration",
